=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Phara} in {z:Bastok Mines} at (J-9).
** She is right beside the {p:Gobbie Mystery Box} at HP #2.
* Go to {z:Davoi} and click the **Hide Flap** at K-9/10.
** This Pops 2 NM's {m:Barakbok} and {m:Gavotvut}.
* Kill them then check the **Hide Flap** to receive the {@k} {k:Sword grip material}.
** The **Hide Flap** moves to a random spot in this area once you check it. It can be in the same spot.
** If multiple people are doing the quest, you will have to wait 5 min to pop again.
* Speak to {n:Phara} then wait a game day (after clock rolls around past 00:00).
* Speak to {n:Phara} again for {@k} {k:Yasin's sword}.
* Speak to {p:Naji} outside the President's Office in {z:Metalworks} at (J-8) for a cutscene to finish the quest and receive your {p:Razor Axe}. You may have to speak to him twice.

